#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_Lounge2/scripts.inc:115
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_Lounge2_Text_FrontierManiacIntro"
msgid ""
"Howdy! When it comes to news about\n"
"the BATTLE FRONTIER, I'm no. 1.\p"
"You can think of me as\n"
"the FRONTIER MANIAC.\p"
"Just checking, but you are a TRAINER,\n"
"isn't that right?\p"
"I'll happily share the hottest news\n"
"I gathered about the BATTLE FRONTIER.$"
msgstr ""
"你好！说到对战开拓区的消息，\n"
"我可是第一名。\p"
"你可以叫我\n"
"开拓区狂热者。\p"
"先确认一下，\n"
"你是训练家，没错吧？\p"
"我很乐意和你分享我收集到的\n"
"对战开拓区最热门的消息。$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_Lounge2/scripts.inc:125
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_Lounge2_Text_SwingByForTheLatestWord"
msgid ""
"Howdy! Did you swing by to grill me\n"
"about the latest word? Oh, all right!$"
msgstr ""
"你好！你是特地来\n"
"打听最新消息的吗？好吧！$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_Lounge2/scripts.inc:130
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_Lounge2_Text_MyInformationsBeenUsefulRight"
msgid ""
"Well? Well? Well?\p"
"I'm sure my information's been\n"
"seriously useful to you, right?$"
msgstr ""
"怎么样？怎么样？怎么样？\p"
"我的消息对你来说\n"
"一定非常有用吧？$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_Lounge2/scripts.inc:135
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_Lounge2_Text_FacilityIsHottest"
msgid ""
"Let's see now…\p"
"It sounds like the {STR_VAR_1}\n"
"is the hottest place going.$"
msgstr ""
"我看看……\p"
"现在最热门的地方\n"
"好像是{STR_VAR_1}。$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_Lounge2/scripts.inc:140
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_Lounge2_Text_BattleTowerIsHottest"
msgid ""
"Let's see now…\p"
"It sounds like BATTLE TOWER\n"
"{STR_VAR_1} is the hottest.$"
msgstr ""
"我看看……\p"
"现在最热门的好像是\n"
"对战塔的{STR_VAR_1}对战。$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_Lounge2/scripts.inc:145
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_Lounge2_Text_SalonMaidenIsThere"
msgid ""
"Bet you didn't know this!\p"
"One of those top TRAINERS that SCOTT\n"
"calls the FRONTIER BRAINS is there.\p"
"It's this mysterious TRAINER called\n"
"the SALON MAIDEN that runs the place.$"
msgstr ""
"这个你肯定不知道吧！\p"
"那里有一位被亚希达称为\n"
"开拓头脑的顶尖训练家。\p"
"管理那里的是一位\n"
"被称为沙龙少女的神秘训练家。$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_Lounge2/scripts.inc:152
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_Lounge2_Text_SalonMaidenSilverMons"
msgid ""
"Have you battled the SALON MAIDEN?\p"
"When she's measuring up her opponent,\n"
"she apparently uses these POKéMON:\p"
"A PSYCHIC-type PSI POKéMON,\n"
"a FIRE-type VOLCANO POKéMON,\l"
"and a NORMAL-type SLEEPING POKéMON.$"
msgstr ""
"你和沙龙少女对战过吗？\p"
"在试探对手实力的时候，\n"
"她好像会使用这些宝可梦：\p"
"超能力属性的念力宝可梦、\n"
"火属性的火山宝可梦，\l"
"以及一般属性的瞌睡宝可梦。$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_Lounge2/scripts.inc:160
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_Lounge2_Text_SalonMaidenGoldMons"
msgid ""
"Have you battled the SALON MAIDEN\n"
"when she's serious?\p"
"When she's battling flat out,\n"
"she apparently uses these POKéMON:\p"
"A DRAGON & PSYCHIC EON POKéMON,\n"
"an ELECTRIC-type THUNDER POKéMON,\l"
"and a NORMAL-type SLEEPING POKéMON.$"
msgstr ""
"你和认真起来的\n"
"沙龙少女对战过吗？\p"
"在全力对战的时候，\n"
"她好像会使用这些宝可梦：\p"
"龙和超能力属性的无限宝可梦、\n"
"电属性的天雷宝可梦，\l"
"以及一般属性的瞌睡宝可梦。$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_Lounge2/scripts.inc:169
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_Lounge2_Text_DomeAceIsThere"
msgid ""
"Bet you didn't know this!\p"
"One of those top TRAINERS that SCOTT\n"
"calls the FRONTIER BRAINS is there.\p"
"It's this flamboyant TRAINER called\n"
"the DOME ACE that runs the place.$"
msgstr ""
"这个你肯定不知道吧！\p"
"那里有一位被亚希达称为\n"
"开拓头脑的顶尖训练家。\p"
"管理那里的是一位\n"
"被称为巨蛋王牌的华丽训练家。$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_Lounge2/scripts.inc:176
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_Lounge2_Text_DomeAceSilverMons"
msgid ""
"Have you battled the DOME ACE?\p"
"When he's treating the opponent\n"
"lightly, he uses these three POKéMON:\p"
"A DRAGON & FLYING DRAGON POKéMON,\n"
"a WATER & GROUND MUD FISH POKéMON,\l"
"and a FIRE & FLYING FLAME POKéMON.$"
msgstr ""
"你和巨蛋王牌对战过吗？\p"
"在轻松应付对手的时候，\n"
"他会使用这3只宝可梦：\p"
"龙和飞行属性的龙宝可梦、\n"
"水和地面属性的沼鱼宝可梦，\l"
"以及火和飞行属性的火焰宝可梦。$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_Lounge2/scripts.inc:184
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_Lounge2_Text_DomeAceGoldMons"
msgid ""
"Have you battled the DOME ACE\n"
"when he's serious?\p"
"When he's demonstrating his strategy,\n"
"he uses these three POKéMON:\p"
"A DRAGON & FLYING EON POKéMON,\n"
"a WATER & GROUND MUD FISH POKéMON,\l"
"and a STEEL- & PSYCHIC-type IRON LEG\l"
"POKéMON.$"
msgstr ""
"你和认真起来的\n"
"巨蛋王牌对战过吗？\p"
"在展现他的战术的时候，\n"
"他会使用这3只宝可梦：\p"
"龙和飞行属性的无限宝可梦、\n"
"水和地面属性的沼鱼宝可梦，\l"
"以及钢和超能力属性的\l"
"铁足宝可梦。$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_Lounge2/scripts.inc:194
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_Lounge2_Text_FactoryHeadIsThere"
msgid ""
"Bet you didn't know this!\p"
"One of those top TRAINERS that SCOTT\n"
"calls the FRONTIER BRAINS is there.\p"
"It's this freaky TRAINER called\n"
"the FACTORY HEAD that runs the place.$"
msgstr ""
"这个你肯定不知道吧！\p"
"那里有一位被亚希达称为\n"
"开拓头脑的顶尖训练家。\p"
"管理那里的是一位\n"
"被称为工厂主管的怪异训练家。$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_Lounge2/scripts.inc:201
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_Lounge2_Text_FactoryHeadSilverMons"
msgid ""
"Have you battled the FACTORY HEAD\n"
"already?\p"
"Let me think… When he goes to battle,\n"
"he just gets three rental POKéMON.\p"
"He battles under pretty much the same\n"
"conditions as you.$"
msgstr ""
"你已经和工厂主管对战过了吗？\p"
"我想想……他对战的时候，\n"
"也只是租借3只宝可梦而已。\p"
"他对战的条件\n"
"几乎和你一样。$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_Lounge2/scripts.inc:209
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_Lounge2_Text_FactoryHeadGoldMons"
msgid ""
"Have you battled the FACTORY HEAD\n"
"when he's serious?\p"
"When he goes seriously to battle,\n"
"he still gets three rental POKéMON.\p"
"He battles under virtually the same\n"
"conditions as you.$"
msgstr ""
"你和认真起来的\n"
"工厂主管对战过吗？\p"
"就算是认真对战的时候，\n"
"他也还是租借3只宝可梦。\p"
"他对战的条件\n"
"几乎和你完全一样。$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_Lounge2/scripts.inc:217
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_Lounge2_Text_PikeQueenIsThere"
msgid ""
"Bet you didn't know this!\p"
"One of those top TRAINERS that SCOTT\n"
"calls the FRONTIER BRAINS is there.\p"
"It's this scary TRAINER called\n"
"the PIKE QUEEN that runs the place.$"
msgstr ""
"这个你肯定不知道吧！\p"
"那里有一位被亚希达称为\n"
"开拓头脑的顶尖训练家。\p"
"管理那里的是一位\n"
"被称为管道女王的可怕训练家。$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_Lounge2/scripts.inc:224
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_Lounge2_Text_PikeQueenSilverMons"
msgid ""
"Have you battled the PIKE QUEEN\n"
"before?\p"
"When she's in a good mood, they say\n"
"she uses these three POKéMON:\p"
"A POISON-type FANG SNAKE POKéMON,\n"
"a BUG & ROCK MOLD POKéMON,\l"
"and a WATER-type TENDER POKéMON.$"
msgstr ""
"你和管道女王对战过吗？\p"
"据说她心情好的时候，\n"
"会使用这3只宝可梦：\p"
"毒属性的牙蛇宝可梦、\n"
"虫和岩石属性的发酵宝可梦，\l"
"以及水属性的慈爱宝可梦。$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_Lounge2/scripts.inc:233
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_Lounge2_Text_PikeQueenGoldMons"
msgid ""
"Have you battled the PIKE QUEEN\n"
"when she's serious?\p"
"When she's seriously annoyed, they say\n"
"she uses these three POKéMON:\p"
"A POISON-type FANG SNAKE POKéMON,\n"
"a STEEL & GROUND IRON SNAKE POKéMON,\l"
"and a WATER- & FLYING-type ATROCIOUS\l"
"POKéMON.$"
msgstr ""
"你和认真起来的\n"
"管道女王对战过吗？\p"
"据说她真正生气的时候，\n"
"会使用这3只宝可梦：\p"
"毒属性的牙蛇宝可梦、\n"
"钢和地面属性的铁蛇宝可梦，\l"
"以及水和飞行属性的\l"
"凶恶宝可梦。$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_Lounge2/scripts.inc:243
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_Lounge2_Text_ArenaTycoonIsThere"
msgid ""
"Bet you didn't know this!\p"
"One of those top TRAINERS that SCOTT\n"
"calls the FRONTIER BRAINS is there.\p"
"It's this cute TRAINER called\n"
"the ARENA TYCOON that runs the place.$"
msgstr ""
"这个你肯定不知道吧！\p"
"那里有一位被亚希达称为\n"
"开拓头脑的顶尖训练家。\p"
"管理那里的是一位\n"
"被称为竞技场大亨的可爱训练家。$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_Lounge2/scripts.inc:250
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_Lounge2_Text_ArenaTycoonSilverMons"
msgid ""
"Have you battled the ARENA TYCOON\n"
"before?\p"
"When she's assessing the foe's ability,\n"
"she supposedly uses these POKéMON:\p"
"A BUG & FIGHTING SINGLE HORN POKéMON,\n"
"a DARK-type MOONLIGHT POKéMON,\l"
"and a BUG & GHOST SHED POKéMON.$"
msgstr ""
"你和竞技场大亨对战过吗？\p"
"据说在评估对手能力的时候，\n"
"她会使用这些宝可梦：\p"
"虫和格斗属性的独角宝可梦、\n"
"恶属性的月光宝可梦，\l"
"以及虫和幽灵属性的空壳宝可梦。$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_Lounge2/scripts.inc:259
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_Lounge2_Text_ArenaTycoonGoldMons"
msgid ""
"Have you battled the ARENA TYCOON\n"
"when she's serious?\p"
"When she battles for keeps,\n"
"she supposedly uses these POKéMON:\p"
"A DARK-type MOONLIGHT POKéMON,\n"
"a GHOST & POISON SHADOW POKéMON\l"
"and a GRASS- & FIGHTING-type\l"
"MUSHROOM POKéMON.$"
msgstr ""
"你和认真起来的\n"
"竞技场大亨对战过吗？\p"
"据说在动真格的时候，\n"
"她会使用这些宝可梦：\p"
"恶属性的月光宝可梦、\n"
"幽灵和毒属性的影子宝可梦，\l"
"以及草和格斗属性的\l"
"蘑菇宝可梦。$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_Lounge2/scripts.inc:269
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_Lounge2_Text_PalaceMavenIsThere"
msgid ""
"Bet you didn't know this!\p"
"One of those top TRAINERS that SCOTT\n"
"calls the FRONTIER BRAINS is there.\p"
"It's this sinister TRAINER called\n"
"the PALACE MAVEN that runs the place.$"
msgstr ""
"这个你肯定不知道吧！\p"
"那里有一位被亚希达称为\n"
"开拓头脑的顶尖训练家。\p"
"管理那里的是一位被称为\n"
"宫殿守护者的阴森训练家。$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_Lounge2/scripts.inc:276
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_Lounge2_Text_PalaceMavenSilverMons"
msgid ""
"Have you battled the PALACE MAVEN\n"
"before?\p"
"When he's testing the opponent's\n"
"spirit, he's said to use these POKéMON:\p"
"A POISON & FLYING-type BAT POKéMON,\n"
"a NORMAL-type LAZY POKéMON, and a\l"
"WATER- & ICE-type TRANSPORT POKéMON.$"
msgstr ""
"你和宫殿守护者对战过吗？\p"
"据说在考验对手的精神时，\n"
"他会使用这些宝可梦：\p"
"毒和飞行属性的蝙蝠宝可梦、\n"
"一般属性的怕麻烦宝可梦，\l"
"以及水和冰属性的乘载宝可梦。$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_Lounge2/scripts.inc:285
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_Lounge2_Text_PalaceMavenGoldMons"
msgid ""
"Have you battled the PALACE MAVEN\n"
"when he's serious?\p"
"When he throws his entire might into\n"
"battle, he's said to use these POKéMON:\p"
"A FIRE-type LEGENDARY POKéMON,\n"
"a NORMAL-type LAZY POKéMON,\l"
"and a WATER-type AURORA POKéMON.$"
msgstr ""
"你和认真起来的\n"
"宫殿守护者对战过吗？\p"
"据说在倾尽全力对战时，\n"
"他会使用这些宝可梦：\p"
"火属性的传说宝可梦、\n"
"一般属性的怕麻烦宝可梦，\l"
"以及水属性的极光宝可梦。$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_Lounge2/scripts.inc:294
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_Lounge2_Text_PyramidKingIsThere"
msgid ""
"Bet you didn't know this!\p"
"One of those top TRAINERS that SCOTT\n"
"calls the FRONTIER BRAINS is there.\p"
"It's this fiery-hot TRAINER called\n"
"the PYRAMID KING that runs the place.$"
msgstr ""
"这个你肯定不知道吧！\p"
"那里有一位被亚希达称为\n"
"开拓头脑的顶尖训练家。\p"
"管理那里的是一位被称为\n"
"金字塔之王的热血训练家。$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_Lounge2/scripts.inc:301
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_Lounge2_Text_PyramidKingSilverMons"
msgid ""
"Have you battled the PYRAMID KING\n"
"before?\p"
"When he's checking the foe's power,\n"
"he apparently uses these POKéMON:\p"
"A ROCK-type ROCK PEAK POKéMON,\n"
"an ICE-type ICEBERG POKéMON,\l"
"and a STEEL-type IRON POKéMON.$"
msgstr ""
"你和金字塔之王对战过吗？\p"
"在检验对手力量的时候，\n"
"他好像会使用这些宝可梦：\p"
"岩石属性的岩山宝可梦、\n"
"冰属性的冰山宝可梦，\l"
"以及钢属性的黑金宝可梦。$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_Lounge2/scripts.inc:310
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_Lounge2_Text_PyramidKingGoldMons"
msgid ""
"Have you battled the PYRAMID KING\n"
"when he's serious?\p"
"When he's pumped with hot power,\n"
"he apparently uses these POKéMON:\p"
"An ICE & FLYING FREEZE POKéMON, an\n"
"ELECTRIC & FLYING ELECTRIC POKéMON,\l"
"and a FIRE- & FLYING-type FLAME\l"
"POKéMON.$"
msgstr ""
"你和认真起来的\n"
"金字塔之王对战过吗？\p"
"在充满火热力量的时候，\n"
"他好像会使用这些宝可梦：\p"
"冰和飞行属性的冰冻宝可梦、\n"
"电和飞行属性的电击宝可梦，\l"
"以及火和飞行属性的\l"
"火焰宝可梦。$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_Lounge2/scripts.inc:320
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_Lounge2_Text_DoubleBattleAdvice1"
msgid ""
"Sure, there are several places where\n"
"you can enter DOUBLE BATTLES.\p"
"But the DOUBLE BATTLE ROOMS of\n"
"the BATTLE TOWER are, like, basic!\p"
"They're where you should learn about\n"
"how DOUBLE BATTLES are played here\l"
"in the BATTLE FRONTIER.$"
msgstr ""
"确实，有好几个地方\n"
"都可以参加双打对战。\p"
"不过对战塔的双打对战室\n"
"可以说是最基本的！\p"
"在那里你可以学到\n"
"对战开拓区的双打对战\l"
"是怎么进行的。$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_Lounge2/scripts.inc:329
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_Lounge2_Text_DoubleBattleAdvice2"
msgid ""
"Watch yourself in the battles here.\p"
"I hear there are TRAINERS that have\n"
"strategies they developed just for\l"
"DOUBLE BATTLES.$"
msgstr ""
"在这里对战可要小心。\p"
"听说有些训练家专门为双打对战\n"
"研究出了独门战术。$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_Lounge2/scripts.inc:335
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_Lounge2_Text_DoubleBattleAdvice3"
msgid ""
"Once you're confident and comfortable\n"
"with DOUBLE BATTLES here, you should\l"
"think about challenging other places\l"
"offering DOUBLE BATTLES.$"
msgstr ""
"等你对这里的双打对战\n"
"有了自信、也习惯了之后，\l"
"就可以考虑去挑战\l"
"其他有双打对战的地方了。$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_Lounge2/scripts.inc:341
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_Lounge2_Text_MultiBattleAdvice"
msgid ""
"All sorts of TRAINERS gather in\n"
"the BATTLE SALON.\p"
"Just think--you may run into your\n"
"friends or followers!\l"
"You should look carefully!$"
msgstr ""
"对战沙龙里聚集了\n"
"各种各样的训练家。\p"
"想想看，说不定会遇到\n"
"你的朋友或者追随者哦！\l"
"你可要仔细看看！$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_Lounge2/scripts.inc:348
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_Lounge2_Text_LinkMultiBattleAdvice"
msgid ""
"If you're with a friend, head for the\n"
"LINK MULTI BATTLE ROOM.\p"
"If you play with a strong friend,\n"
"you can expect to see tough foes!$"
msgstr ""
"如果有朋友同行，\n"
"就去连接多人对战室吧。\p"
"和厉害的朋友一起玩的话，\n"
"就会遇到强大的对手！$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_Lounge2/scripts.inc:354
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_Lounge2_Text_NewsGatheringPower"
msgid ""
"What amazing news-gathering power!\n"
"My mentor's like none other!$"
msgstr ""
"多么惊人的情报收集能力！\n"
"我的师父真是无人能比！$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_Lounge2/scripts.inc:358
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_Lounge2_Text_AmazingPowersOfObservation"
msgid ""
"What amazing powers of observation!\n"
"My mentor's like none other!$"
msgstr ""
"多么惊人的观察力！\n"
"我的师父真是无人能比！$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_Lounge2/scripts.inc:362
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_Lounge2_Text_AmazingPowerOfPersuasion"
msgid ""
"What amazing power of persuasion!\n"
"My mentor's like none other!$"
msgstr ""
